<<<
salary makes salaried.
===
**salary** makes *salaried*.
>>>

<<<
Salic, Salique. In the most frequent use, i.e. in the name of the law excluding females from dynastic succession, ‘still often spelt Salique | & pronounced salé’k ’"—OED.
===
**Salic, Salique.** In the most frequent use, i.e. in the name of the law excluding females from dynastic succession, 'still often spelt *Salique* & pronounced salē'k'—OED.
>>>

