<<<
same. S. or the s., in the sense the aforesaid thing(s) or person(s), as a substitute for a pronoun (it, him, her, them, they) is one of the usages whose effect is discussed in ILLITER- ACIES.
===
**same.** *S.* or *the s.*, in the sense the aforesaid thing(s) or person(s), as a substitute for a pronoun (*it, him, her, them, they*) is one of the usages whose effect is discussed in ^^ILLITERACIES^^.
>>>

