if they had been content with *it, them,* or other pronoun. *Shops filled to the doors with all kinds of merchandise & people eager to acquire* t. s./*Are the purveyors of* 'bowlers' *able to meet the sudden requirements for* s. *likely to arise immediately on the signing of peace?/
>>>

